    "detailed_description": "<strong>Golel</strong> is a first person dungeon crawler RPG with turn based actions and tile-based movement.<br>Combat is focused on mobility and using the environment to your advantage.<br><strong>Golel</strong> is a disturbing dark fantasy game with horrifying atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/e8b14f90cfb4a70e92bdf9705c8e7421.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/e8b14f90cfb4a70e92bdf9705c8e7421.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRIDING INTO UNNATURAL REALMS</h2>As a fierce warrior disturbed by your own visions, you willingly chose to venture where no other mortals would dare. <br>You'll encounter many hostile monsters and environments, but also some non-hostile entities that may or may not help you in your quest. <br>Each play-through is unique and set different challenges, obstacles and rewards. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/151949a69e3c51b806acf6e338b2723a.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/151949a69e3c51b806acf6e338b2723a.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAMILIAR YET NEW WAYS TO DO DUNGEON CRAWLING</h2>You will have to use different skills and rely on the environment to gain an advantage. <br>You might drop book shelves on a skeleton, kick a zombie into spikes, or flee through narrow passages in the hopes that the monster hunting you cannot follow. <br>Mobility is important, and you will have to rely on it and tactical use of the environment. Your base stats alone will not save you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/cac35c337aeced60c81131b8d6d509a1.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/cac35c337aeced60c81131b8d6d509a1.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP GAMEPLAY</h2>Character development consists of hundreds of different skills, stats and build paths. <br>Different skills and weapons, will unlock different play styles. <br>The world is non linear, and you have some freedom to choose where to travel to.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/6d45e0559378ac80425526c41ece3eee.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/6d45e0559378ac80425526c41ece3eee.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><strong>Golel</strong> has a 30 hours main campaign.<br>There are many combinations of skills, weapons and attributes, that allow for many different play styles.<br>Every weapon has it's own combat talents and tactics.<br><br>You can be a spell caster, or a mix of both a fighter and a spell caster.<br>This allows to finish the campaign in many different ways.<br><br>Some elements are random generated, while others are hand tailored to provide a unique level design.<br>In addition, a completely procedural generated challenge mode can be played endlessly after finishing the main campaign.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/96e16c9a71312f9ba75090581797073c.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/96e16c9a71312f9ba75090581797073c.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Golel</strong> is a first person dungeon crawler RPG with turn based actions and tile-based movement.<br>Combat is focused on mobility and using the environment to your advantage.<br><strong>Golel</strong> is a disturbing dark fantasy game with horrifying atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/e8b14f90cfb4a70e92bdf9705c8e7421.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/e8b14f90cfb4a70e92bdf9705c8e7421.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRIDING INTO UNNATURAL REALMS</h2>As a fierce warrior disturbed by your own visions, you willingly chose to venture where no other mortals would dare. <br>You'll encounter many hostile monsters and environments, but also some non-hostile entities that may or may not help you in your quest. <br>Each play-through is unique and set different challenges, obstacles and rewards. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/151949a69e3c51b806acf6e338b2723a.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/151949a69e3c51b806acf6e338b2723a.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAMILIAR YET NEW WAYS TO DO DUNGEON CRAWLING</h2>You will have to use different skills and rely on the environment to gain an advantage. <br>You might drop book shelves on a skeleton, kick a zombie into spikes, or flee through narrow passages in the hopes that the monster hunting you cannot follow. <br>Mobility is important, and you will have to rely on it and tactical use of the environment. Your base stats alone will not save you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/cac35c337aeced60c81131b8d6d509a1.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/cac35c337aeced60c81131b8d6d509a1.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP GAMEPLAY</h2>Character development consists of hundreds of different skills, stats and build paths. <br>Different skills and weapons, will unlock different play styles. <br>The world is non linear, and you have some freedom to choose where to travel to.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/6d45e0559378ac80425526c41ece3eee.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/6d45e0559378ac80425526c41ece3eee.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><strong>Golel</strong> has a 30 hours main campaign.<br>There are many combinations of skills, weapons and attributes, that allow for many different play styles.<br>Every weapon has it's own combat talents and tactics.<br><br>You can be a spell caster, or a mix of both a fighter and a spell caster.<br>This allows to finish the campaign in many different ways.<br><br>Some elements are random generated, while others are hand tailored to provide a unique level design.<br>In addition, a completely procedural generated challenge mode can be played endlessly after finishing the main campaign.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/96e16c9a71312f9ba75090581797073c.poster.avif?t=1753462670\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577730/extras/96e16c9a71312f9ba75090581797073c.webm?t=1753462670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
